<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Sure Sente — Work. Connect. Earn.</title>
<meta name="description" content="Find nearby work, offer your skills, or earn by introducing buyers. Pilot now live in Kampala." />
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'><circle cx='50' cy='50' r='50' fill='%23052214'/><path d='M35 65 L50 35 L65 65 M42 52 H58' stroke='%23D4AF37' stroke-width='6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'/><path d='M55 28 L72 28 L72 45' stroke='%23D4AF37' stroke-width='5' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'/></svg>" />
<meta name="theme-color" content="#052214" />
<style>
:root { --dark:#052214; --emerald:#0B3B24; --em:#0EA46A; --gold:#D4AF37; --lightGold:#F3E5AB;
  --card: rgba(255,255,255,.07); --border: rgba(212,175,55,.3); --line: rgba(212,175,55,.22);
  --text:#EAF2EC; --muted:#A9C0B2; }
* { box-sizing:border-box; } img { max-width:100%; }
body { margin:0; background:var(--dark); color:var(--text); font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; }
::selection { background:#D4AF37; color:#052214; }
a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible { outline:3px solid var(--gold); outline-offset:2px; }
/* gold utilities */
.gold-grad { background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FFF6D6 0%,#D4AF37 50%,#AA7C11 100%); -webkit-background-clip:text; background-clip:text; -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent; }
.clay { background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,.10) 0%,rgba(255,255,255,.03) 100%); backdrop-filter:blur(16px); -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(16px); border:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,.25); box-shadow:0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.4), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.2); }
.gold-btn { background:linear-gradient(135deg,#F3E5AB 0%,#D4AF37 100%); color:#052214; font-weight:700; transition:all .3s ease; }
.gold-btn:hover { background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FFF6D6 0%,#E5C158 100%); box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(212,175,55,.5); }
.tagchip { display:inline-block; padding:5px 12px; border-radius:999px; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; background:rgba(255,255,255,.07); border:1px solid var(--border); color:var(--gold); font-weight:700; }
/* top nav */
.nav { position:sticky; top:0; z-index:10; background:rgba(5,34,20,.92); backdrop-filter:blur(10px); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
.navin { max-width:1120px; margin:0 auto; padding:10px 20px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; }
.brand { font-weight:800; font-size:19px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; text-decoration:none; color:#F3E5AB; white-space:nowrap; }
.navlinks { display:flex; gap:4px; margin-left:8px; }
.navlinks a { color:var(--text); text-decoration:none; font-weight:600; padding:10px 12px; min-height:44px; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; border-radius:10px; }
.navlinks a:hover { background:rgba(255,255,255,.08); color:var(--gold); }
.navsp { flex:1; }
.loc { background:rgba(212,175,55,.14); border:1px solid var(--border); color:var(--lightGold); border-radius:999px; padding:8px 12px; font-size:14px; font-weight:700; white-space:nowrap; }
.btn { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px; font-weight:700; border-radius:14px; min-height:48px; padding:12px 22px; text-decoration:none; border:none; font-size:16px; cursor:pointer; }
.btn.ghost { background:rgba(255,255,255,.07); color:var(--text); border:1px solid var(--border); }
.btn.ghost:hover { border-color:var(--gold); }
.signin { color:var(--text); font-weight:600; min-height:44px; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; padding:0 8px; white-space:nowrap; }
.signin:hover { color:var(--gold); }
/* layout */
.wrap { max-width:1120px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 20px 40px; position:relative; }
/* hero */
.hero { position:relative; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.05fr 1fr; gap:32px; align-items:center; padding:40px 0 28px; overflow:hidden; }
.blob { position:absolute; width:420px; height:420px; border-radius:999px; pointer-events:none; }
.hero .eyebrow { display:inline-block; background:rgba(255,255,255,.07); border:1px solid var(--border); color:var(--gold); font-weight:700; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase; border-radius:999px; padding:6px 14px; margin-bottom:10px; }
.hero h1 { font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,58px); margin:0 0 10px; line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:-.5px; }
.hero p.sub { font-size:18px; margin:0 0 20px; max-width:46ch; color:var(--muted); }
.ctaRow { display:flex; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.cap { font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); margin:8px 0 0; }
.livebar { display:flex; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top:16px; font-size:14px; font-weight:700; }
.livebar span { background:rgba(255,255,255,.07); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:999px; padding:6px 14px; }
.heroImg { border-radius:24px; overflow:hidden; position:relative; }
.heroImg img { display:block; width:100%; height:100%; max-height:440px; object-fit:cover; transition:transform .7s ease; }
.heroImg:hover img { transform:scale(1.04); }
/* pills */
.chips { display:flex; gap:10px; margin:6px 0 4px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.chip { padding:10px 18px; min-height:44px; border-radius:12px; border:1px solid var(--line); background:rgba(255,255,255,.07); font-weight:700; font-size:15px; color:var(--text); }
.chip.on { background:linear-gradient(135deg,#F3E5AB,#D4AF37); border-color:transparent; color:#052214; }
/* sections */
.sec { padding:26px 0 6px; } .sec h2 { font-size:26px; margin:0 0 4px; } .sec p.lead { margin:0 0 14px; color:var(--muted); }
.cards3 { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:18px; }
.catcard { border-radius:20px; overflow:hidden; min-width:0; }
.catcard:hover { border-color:var(--gold); }
.catcard img { display:block; width:100%; height:170px; object-fit:cover; background:#0B3B24; }
.catcard .pad { padding:14px 16px 16px; } .catcard h3 { margin:0 0 4px; font-size:18px; color:#F3E5AB; }
.catcard p { margin:0 0 10px; font-size:15px; color:var(--muted); }
.catcard a { font-weight:700; color:var(--gold); min-height:44px; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; }
/* listings */
.listgrid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:18px; }
.job { border-radius:20px; overflow:hidden; display:flex; gap:14px; padding:14px; min-width:0; }
.job img { width:96px; height:96px; flex:none; border-radius:14px; object-fit:cover; background:#0B3B24; }
.job .b { flex:1; min-width:0; } .job b.t { display:block; font-size:17px; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap; }
.job small { color:var(--muted); } .pay { color:var(--gold); font-weight:800; margin:4px 0 0; }
.empty { border:1px dashed var(--border); border-radius:20px; padding:24px; text-align:center; color:var(--muted); }
/* how */
.steps { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:18px; }
.step { border-radius:20px; padding:18px; }
.step .n { display:inline-flex; width:36px; height:36px; border-radius:50%; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#F3E5AB,#D4AF37); color:#052214; font-weight:800; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:8px; }
.step h3 { margin:0 0 4px; color:#F3E5AB; } .step p { margin:0; font-size:15px; color:var(--muted); }
/* trust band */
.trust { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1.2fr; gap:24px; align-items:center; border-radius:24px; padding:24px; margin-top:30px; }
.trust h2 { margin:0; } .trust img { width:100%; border-radius:16px; height:220px; object-fit:cover; background:#0B3B24; }
.trust ul { margin:8px 0 0; padding-left:20px; } .trust li { margin:6px 0; }
/* footer */
.foot { border-top:1px solid var(--line); margin-top:36px; padding:20px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; }
.foot a { color:var(--text); margin:0 10px; min-height:44px; display:inline-block; font-weight:600; }
.foot a:hover { color:var(--gold); }
.credit { font-size:12px; color:var(--muted); margin-top:6px; }
.apibar { font-size:13px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.06); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:12px; padding:10px 12px; margin-top:14px; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
.apibar a { color:var(--gold); }
/* mobile */
@media (max-width:860px){
  .navlinks { display:none; }
  .hero { grid-template-columns:1fr; padding:24px 0 12px; }
  .heroImg img { max-height:230px; }
  .cards3, .steps { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  .listgrid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  .trust { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  .wrap { padding:0 16px 32px; } .navin { padding:10px 16px; }
  .loc { max-width:38vw; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="nav"><div class="navin">
  <a class="brand" href="/"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="14" cy="20" r="9" fill="none" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="5"/><circle cx="26" cy="20" r="9" fill="none" stroke="#0EA46A" stroke-width="5"/></svg> Sure Sente</a>
  <nav class="navlinks" aria-label="Sections"><a href="http://localhost:5173/find">Work</a><a href="http://localhost:5173/services">Services</a><a href="http://localhost:5173/deals">Deals</a><a href="http://localhost:5173/help">Help</a></nav>
  <span class="navsp"></span>
  <span class="loc">📍 Kampala · pilot</span>
  <a class="signin" href="http://localhost:5173/auth">Sign in</a>
  <a class="btn gold-btn" href="http://localhost:5173/auth">Join free</a>
</div></header>

<div class="wrap">
  <div class="blob" style="top:-120px; left:-120px; background:radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(14,164,106,.20), transparent);"></div>
  <div class="blob" style="bottom:-160px; right:-120px; background:radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(212,175,55,.12), transparent);"></div>

  <section class="hero">
    <div style="position:relative; z-index:1;">
      <span class="eyebrow">Pilot now live in Kampala</span>
      <h1 class="gold-grad">Work. Connect. Earn.</h1>
      <p class="sub">Find nearby work, offer your skills, or earn by introducing buyers.</p>
      <div class="ctaRow">
        <a class="btn gold-btn" href="http://localhost:5173/auth">Join free →</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="#explore">Explore opportunities</a>
      </div>
      <p class="cap">Browse first. Sign up to apply or connect.</p>
      <div class="livebar" aria-label="Live marketplace counts">
        <span><%= length(listings) %> open listings</span>
        <span><%= length(categories) %> open categories</span>
        <span>UGX pay shown upfront</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="heroImg clay" style="padding:8px; position:relative; z-index:1;">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541888946425-d81bb19240f5?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1200&amp;q=60" alt="Artisans collaborating on a building site" fetchpriority="high" style="border-radius:18px;" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec" aria-label="Categories" style="position:relative; z-index:1;"><h2 class="gold-grad">Elevated opportunities</h2><p class="lead">One account: find shifts, offer services, or earn agreed commissions on introductions.</p>
    <div class="cards3">
      <div class="catcard clay">
        <img loading="lazy" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504307651254-35680f356dfd?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=60" alt="Workers on a steel structure" />
        <div class="pad"><h3>Find work</h3><p>Nearby paid tasks and shifts with pay and schedule shown upfront. No CV needed.</p><a href="http://localhost:5173/find">Browse work →</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="catcard clay">
        <img loading="lazy" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621905251189-08b45d6a269e?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=60" alt="Electrician at work" />
        <div class="pad"><h3>Book services</h3><p>Local skills with clear prices. Request a quote and agree the scope in writing.</p><a href="http://localhost:5173/services">Browse services →</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="catcard clay">
        <img loading="lazy" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1488459716781-31db52582fe9?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=60" alt="Fresh produce at a market stall" />
        <div class="pad"><h3>Deals &amp; goods</h3><p>Everyday goods with visible prices and seller-authorised broker commissions.</p><a href="http://localhost:5173/deals">Browse deals →</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec" id="explore" aria-label="Nearby opportunities" style="position:relative; z-index:1;"><h2 class="gold-grad">Explore near you</h2><p class="lead">Live from the marketplace — pay and commission terms always visible.</p>
    <%= if listings == [] do %>
      <div class="empty"><p>No published listings yet — check back soon, or be the first to post a need.</p></div>
    <% else %>
      <div class="listgrid">
      <%= for l <- listings do %>
        <div class="job clay">
          <img loading="lazy" alt="" src="<%= case l["kind"] do
            "service" -> "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621905251189-08b45d6a269e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=300&q=50"
            "deal" -> "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1488459716781-31db52582fe9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=300&q=50"
            _ -> "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504307651254-35680f356dfd?auto=format&fit=crop&w=300&q=50"
          end %>" />
          <div class="b">
            <b class="t"><%= l["title"] %></b>
            <small><%= l["coarse_location"] || "Uganda" %> · <%= l["kind"] %></small>
            <p class="pay">UGX <%= (l["pay_amount_minor"] || 0) |> trunc() |> Integer.to_string() |> String.replace(~r/\B(?=(\d{3})+(?!\d))/, ",") %> total</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      <% end %>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </section>

  <section class="sec" aria-label="How it works" style="position:relative; z-index:1;"><h2 class="gold-grad">How Sure Sente works</h2><p class="lead">Browse freely. An account is only needed when you act.</p>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step clay"><span class="n">1</span><h3>Browse &amp; compare</h3><p>Search work, services and deals with pay, schedules and terms visible before signup.</p></div>
      <div class="step clay"><span class="n">2</span><h3>Apply or book</h3><p>Create an account to apply, message, quote or book. Every agreement is confirmed in writing.</p></div>
      <div class="step clay"><span class="n">3</span><h3>Work &amp; earn</h3><p>Complete the job and get paid directly. Brokers earn only on consented, attributed introductions.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="trust clay" aria-label="Trust and safety" style="position:relative; z-index:1;">
    <img loading="lazy" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521791136064-7986c2920216?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=60" alt="Two people shaking hands" />
    <div><h2 class="gold-grad">Fair terms, in writing</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>No wallet, no escrow — buyers pay workers and sellers directly.</li>
        <li>Broker commission needs seller approval, buyer consent and accepted attribution.</li>
        <li>Private contacts, documents and messages stay private and permissioned.</li>
        <li>Disputes and appeals are handled with evidence and audit history.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="apibar">Developers: API live at <b>/api/v1</b> — <a href="/api/v1/categories">/categories</a> · <a href="/api/v1/listings">/listings</a>. Full interactive app: <a href="http://localhost:5173">localhost:5173</a>.</div>
</div>

<footer class="foot">
  <a href="http://localhost:5173/help">Terms</a>|<a href="http://localhost:5173/help">Privacy</a>|<a href="http://localhost:5173/help">Help</a>
  <p class="credit">Photos: Unsplash (free to use). Illustrative listing photos; listing details come from the live marketplace.</p>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
